ntly and can then choose to keep or disable them."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use this for a “soft opt-in” strategy to avoid users declining the permission prompt upfront.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNAuthorizationOptionCriticalAlert"},{"type":"text","text":" (iOS 12+) — Allows notifications that bypass Do Not Disturb and the mute switch."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Requires a special entitlement from Apple (must be approved via Apple Developer portal)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Intended for medical, health, safety, and public security apps.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNAuthorizationOptionProvidesAppNotificationSettings","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (iOS 12+) — Adds a “Configure in App” button","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"to the system notification settings for your app. When tapped, iOS calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userNotificationCenter:openSettingsForNotification:"},{"text":" on your ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/addNotificationCenterDelegate:","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to register your delegate and handle this callback."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"UNAuthorizationOptionAnnouncement","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (iOS 13+) — Allows Siri to automatically read out notifications","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"through AirPods and compatible headphones."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Example — Provisional (Soft Opt-In)","type":"heading","anchor":"Example-Provisional-Soft-Opt-In"},{"code":